     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">I did indeed load the sem-package too because of another example.</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">The problem is now solved by using lavaan::sem in the program.</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">It is not a good idea to use the same name for that funcion in lavaan...</font></div><div> </div></div>"
    ]
